YEL蒙面人：可恶，你们给我等着！NOR]]}},{type="gaintab",args={"315008",9}},{type="outobject",args={"rwnpc01_14"}},{type="refresh",args={}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},rwnpc02={id="rwnpc02",baseId="rwnpc12",combatid={1,1001},name="平遥公主",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL平遥公主：好，很好。于习武之人而言，经脉之重要，自是不言而喻。各门各派若有秘传功法，无不是深藏于内，此乃江湖常理。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL平遥公主：未曾想，这世间竟有如此胸怀大义之人，甘愿将自家密法公之于众，传于天下，真真令我钦佩不已。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL平遥公主：可惜，我来晚几日，未能目睹当日盛况。不知道这位公子现今身在何处？几位可否为我引荐一番。NOR"}},{type="gaintab",args={"315008",1}},{type="addobject",args={"rwnpc03"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName2="交谈",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"YEL平遥公主：怎可如此疏忽大意？尽快寻到箫公子，不可让他遭遇凶险。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"315008",2}}}},autoResult1={{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},